    "_comment": "Browser shape of /api/questions v2 (camelCase), converted from the question agent's contract example (qa-agente docs/contrato/rondas-ejemplo.json). round1 and round2 are templates written in mode 'paciente' and carry the medical-view fields (rationale, genesIfYes, genesIfNo, which is always empty now that the agent sends the model only the findings answered «Sí»); the mocks null those for 'paciente' and swap in `medico` wording for 'medico', per round, as the agent does. Each round re-runs the model with the findings answered «Sí», so a ranking's `modelRank` is the gene's place in that ranking itself (the screen measures moves against the first /rank-genes list, never from it) and its `specialties` are the re-run's. Finished rounds take their summary from `summaries` by mode; interpretedAnswers are recomputed from the actual answers of every round. Each question carries `label`, the official Spanish HPO label. A summary only recaps what was asked, what was answered and how the list moved: it never suggests a study or a clinical step, in either mode.",
